  "authorization": "The persistent user objective explicitly includes a new mechanism, robot comparison and additional assessment. This bounded prospective replication supersedes only our self-imposed prohibition on new-scene assessment after a failed development gate. It does not promote any candidate, rewrite past results, claim successful development, or authorize parameter tuning on new scenes.",
  "selection": "Two first lexicographic official validation windows in previously unused sequences with >=100 posed frames and >200m trajectory XY AABB separation from all seven exposed sequences and each other. Fixed before RGB inspection and reference decode. 50+34 sampled paired frames, not full sequences or official server.",
  "primary": "Exact unchanged revision_authorization_v1 Ours: selected cover mask witnesses, complete-link legacy identity authorization with one-view-deletion margin, local identity competition and certified writes. It failed development; this is a prospective replication of its mechanism, not another revised method.",
  "controls": {
    "strong_baseline": "Unchanged SAM3/SigLIP CG history2 plus frozen intrinsic geometry, raw mask geometric expansion and source-frame certified full-LiDAR support. Same as the current strong baseline (ours_frame in the prior assessment).",
