  },
  "backbone": "Reuse the separately validated input/front-end/geometry/semantic pipeline from batch_transport_assessment_v1. Intrinsic model was trained on 0000/0002 only. SAM3 car/building threshold0.5 frontend, all positive raw masks for cover, frozen SigLIP+CGhistory2, frozen 19-class SegFormer. No new fitting or model switch.",
  "budgets": "Exactly 2 new windows, 8 final maps, 24 full scores (primary, raw-reference diagnostic and uniform-score diagnostic). Shared inference only once per original pipeline stage/frame; no seed, parameter, class, window replacement or model sweep. Intermediate backbone outputs are not additional candidate selection trials.",
  "efficacy": "Evaluate full_authorization without candidate selection: primary AP and AP50 must be >= strong_baseline in EACH window; mean primary AP must exceed strong by at least 0.01 and strictly exceed both controls; at least one new raw-target AP50 match and zero lost raw matches; nonzero historical edits. Empty-class/window scores remain NA with actual reference counts, not zeros or replacement scenes. Fewer than two eligible windows cannot establish this criterion. Secondary control success does not promote it; report all differences and losses.",
  "scoring": "Same full static reference, confidence-weighted building/car AP50:90, AP50, AP25, strict20cm nearest-map readout; all reference targets retained, including uncovered targets. Raw-target and uniform-score views remain diagnostic. Report all per-object best IoU/IDs and new/lost matches, no oracle region splicing.",
  "execution_gate": "Before new RGB/model inference: finish data SHA/CRC/timing/calibration checks, prove measurement-space separation, seal isolated execution adapters, and validate changed adapters against exposed golden outputs. All eight final maps must be frozen before decoding either reference. Separate execution seals may add paths/wrappers only, not alter this scientific protocol.",
  "robot": "The same four versions already have full330frame rosbag2245 outputs in revision_robot_v1 and revision_factorial_v1. Independently verify correspondence and link those sealed outputs, rather than rerunning identical maps and counting them as new validation. No robot GT: no semantic accuracy, S100 runtime or deployment claim; those remain explicit limits.",
